    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking about the timetable",
     "texto": [
      "**La ce oră pleacă...?** means «What time does ... leave?». To say where a journey goes from and to, we use **de la... până la...**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Departures and arrivals",
     "texto": [
      "**Plecarea** is «the departure» and **sosirea**, «the arrival». **Peron** is the platform; **orar** is the timetable. **Destinație** is «destination»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
